{{default_toolsets_table}}

Optional opt-in built-in toolsets (disabled by default until configured; {{optional_toolset_count}} total, plus optional plugin toolsets such as `a2a`): {{optional_toolsets_inline}}.

### {{device_capability_count}} approved Android device bridge capabilities

When the Android app includes `device_capabilities` on a `/v1/runs` request, Hermes may request any advertised action through `request_device_action`, pausing the run until the user taps **Allow** or **Deny** on their phone ({{core_device_capability_count}} core OS capabilities plus {{deep_android_action_count}} deep Android 16 actions):

{{device_capabilities_list}}

